 "<div style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:#7fb8e6\">2</div><div><b>Da una vuelta</b></div><div style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,'SFMono-Regular',Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace;font-size:16px;color:#a9bdd1\">'spin360' · después</div>": "<div style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:#7fb8e6\">2</div><div><b>Bira bat eman</b></div><div style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,'SFMono-Regular',Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace;font-size:16px;color:#a9bdd1\">'spin360' · ondoren</div>",
