 "<div style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:#50e3c2\">4</div><div><b>Se va</b></div><div style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,'SFMono-Regular',Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace;font-size:16px;color:#a9bdd1\">'fade-out' · clic</div>": "<div style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:#50e3c2\">4</div><div><b>Joan</b></div><div style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,'SFMono-Regular',Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace;font-size:16px;color:#a9bdd1\">'fade-out' · klik</div>",
